<title>RUSSIA: WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - June 20.</title>
<headline>WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - June 20.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airports in the North Caucasus may be closed on June 20 due to heavy thunderstorms, the Russian Weather Service said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The probability of closure was 80 percent, the service said.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
<p>www.racs.com</p>
